WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.850
In 2018, a Christian bakery in Belfast
refused to ice a cake with a slogan backing

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.510
same-sex marriage.

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.350
The case went all the
way to the Supreme Court.

4
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.690
Meanwhile, every state school must
hold daily collective worship,

5
00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:17.210
yet parents may withdraw their children.

6
00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.710
So where do faith and
secular values clash?

7
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.600
In this mission, you'll
explore four arenas:

8
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.680
schools, marriage law,
equality law and medicine.

9
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:30.320
Then you'll compare how
Christians, Muslims,

10
00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.930
Jews, Buddhists and Hindus
respond to abortion,

11
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.190
euthanasia and IVF.

12
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.990
Your mission: map where faith
and secular law collide,

13
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.800
and how each side responds.
